{
 "header": [
  "The page's extended plan for N64Recomp-browser's tools/play_page.mjs, at most 5 minutes, for when a longer play than",
  "the regular one (web/play_plan.json) is needed: the launcher, Load ROM on a new profile once the shader list Chrome",
  "builds behind it is done (Firefox builds none there and says so), Start Game, then through the menus as a player",
  "(web/shader_plan.json's header has the keys and the RDRAM it reads) to two races in one load in the first car, ONE",
  "RACE on Las Vegas, driven about 35 s and left by the pause menu's QUIT and YES, then on Alcatraz, about 25 s. The",
  "race's start is a need that the game is racing (game_state 0x8010C0D0 3) on the track asked for (0x8010C3F0) in ONE",
  "RACE (0x8010C3E8). The No Race Timer cheat is on (0x800D9E88), so a race driven blind never runs out of time. A race",
  "is driven by the race layout's keys (src/controls.cpp: the gas ArrowUp, steering ArrowLeft and ArrowRight; Space, the",
  "menus' A, is the wings' key there), the gas held and a weave, its waits and holds on the game's clock (timer_game_time",
  "0x80117488, seconds), with a shot about 5 s in and a need there that the car is doing 15 mph or more."
